OL,3,GNEWSAUK-Iranian dual national arrested
OL,4,Aover RAF Fairford incident, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK-Iranian dual national has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of preparation of
OL,8,Fterrorist acts in connection with the
OL,9,Fincident at RAF Fairford,
OL,10,Fcounter-terror police have said.
OL,12,FThe 27-year-old man was arrested in
OL,13,FWestminster, London.
OL,15,FA second man, a 26-year-old UK
OL,16,Fnational, has also been questioned
OL,17,Funder caution, and two properties in
OL,18,Fthe area have been searched.
OL,20,FFive men in their twenties who were
OL,21,Farrested near the airbase on Sunday
OL,22,Fremain on police bail.
